#### Example 4: Storage Isolation Test

_[To be completed]_

```typescript
// Test for localStorage/sessionStorage isolation
test('extension cannot access other tenant storage', async ({ page }) => {
  // Set up tenant A data
  await page.evaluate(() => {
    localStorage.setItem('tenant-a-data', 'sensitive-data');
  });

  // Load tenant B extension
  await page.goto('http://localhost:3000/?tenant=tenant-b');

  // Attempt to access tenant A data from extension
  const canAccessOtherTenantData = await page.evaluate(() => {
    const data = localStorage.getItem('tenant-a-data');
    return data !== null;
  });

  // Should not be able to access other tenant's data
  expect(canAccessOtherTenantData).toBe(false);
});
```
